{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "01509",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 1.39,
      "end_seconds": 2.92,
      "duration_seconds": 1.53,
      "text": "Good afternoon, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 4.5,
      "end_seconds": 8.26,
      "duration_seconds": 3.76,
      "text": "Yes, have a seat. Tell me what's going on."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 10.17,
      "end_seconds": 13.56,
      "duration_seconds": 3.39,
      "text": "It's burning pain before the rash, mostly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 14.47,
      "end_seconds": 16.26,
      "duration_seconds": 1.79,
      "text": "When did this begin?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 20.14,
      "end_seconds": 25.34,
      "duration_seconds": 5.2,
      "text": "It's, It's been about four days, I'm fairly sure."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 26.24,
      "end_seconds": 30.28,
      "duration_seconds": 4.04,
      "text": "Any a painful blistering rash on one side as well?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 31.51,
      "end_seconds": 32.65,
      "duration_seconds": 1.14,
      "text": "Yes, actually."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 33.19,
      "end_seconds": 34.06,
      "duration_seconds": 0.87,
      "text": "I follow."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 35.28,
      "end_seconds": 38.42,
      "duration_seconds": 3.14,
      "text": "There's sensitivity to clothes touching as well."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 57.19,
      "end_seconds": 61.48,
      "duration_seconds": 4.29,
      "text": "Let me check a few things. Any fever or weakness?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 62.88,
      "end_seconds": 65.26,
      "duration_seconds": 2.38,
      "text": "No, no fever or weakness."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 66.56,
      "end_seconds": 71.22,
      "duration_seconds": 4.66,
      "text": "And what about eye involvement or rash across the midline?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 74.96,
      "end_seconds": 77.19,
      "duration_seconds": 2.23,
      "text": "None of those, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 78.4,
      "end_seconds": 80.42,
      "duration_seconds": 2.02,
      "text": "Any trouble with the waterworks?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 81.56,
      "end_seconds": 83.32,
      "duration_seconds": 1.76,
      "text": "Nothing there, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 85.02,
      "end_seconds": 87.55,
      "duration_seconds": 2.53,
      "text": "Have you had any previous surgeries?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 89.58,
      "end_seconds": 94.55,
      "duration_seconds": 4.97,
      "text": "So, uh, nothing, I haven't had any operations."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 95.96,
      "end_seconds": 99.87,
      "duration_seconds": 3.91,
      "text": "What do you take on a normal day?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 100.44,
      "end_seconds": 106.97,
      "duration_seconds": 6.53,
      "text": "It's pantoprazole, 40 milligrams, before breakfast. It's paracetamol, 1 gram, when needed."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 118.6,
      "end_seconds": 122.5,
      "duration_seconds": 3.9,
      "text": "Any health conditions I should have on record?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 123.01,
      "end_seconds": 124.84,
      "duration_seconds": 1.83,
      "text": "I've got acid reflux."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 126.82,
      "end_seconds": 138.74,
      "duration_seconds": 11.92,
      "text": "Right, so acid reflux is already on your record. We'll keep that in mind today. Do you react to any medicines or foods? Any allergies?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 139.79,
      "end_seconds": 143.19,
      "duration_seconds": 3.4,
      "text": "No, nothing as far as I know."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 143.92,
      "end_seconds": 146.88,
      "duration_seconds": 2.96,
      "text": "Now some background about your lifestyle."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 148.2,
      "end_seconds": 159.24,
      "duration_seconds": 11.04,
      "text": "I'm vegetarian and have been for years. I look after my grandchildren most days. No, I share a house with my brother."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 160.32,
      "end_seconds": 163.21,
      "duration_seconds": 2.89,
      "text": "Let's start with the basic checks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 173.93,
      "end_seconds": 176.36,
      "duration_seconds": 2.43,
      "text": "Bear with me while this finishes..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 196.99,
      "end_seconds": 210.4,
      "duration_seconds": 13.41,
      "text": "Okay: temperature is 37.0 degrees, height 174 centimetres, weight 78 kilos. And BP is 110 over 71, pulse is 77 beats a minute, BMI works out to 25.8."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 211.86,
      "end_seconds": 213.32,
      "duration_seconds": 1.46,
      "text": "Is that okay?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 214.52,
      "end_seconds": 218.2,
      "duration_seconds": 3.68,
      "text": "Don't worry, we'll discuss it in a second."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 219.22,
      "end_seconds": 223.75,
      "duration_seconds": 4.53,
      "text": "Alright, over here please and I'll take a look."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 225.04,
      "end_seconds": 226.01,
      "duration_seconds": 0.97,
      "text": "That's alright."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 227.29,
      "end_seconds": 229.42,
      "duration_seconds": 2.13,
      "text": "Tell me if that's sore."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 248.03,
      "end_seconds": 256.09,
      "duration_seconds": 8.06,
      "text": "There are grouped blisters on a red base along one band on the right side and none cross the midline."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 257.11,
      "end_seconds": 258.06,
      "duration_seconds": 0.95,
      "text": "That's alright."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 260.81,
      "end_seconds": 263.13,
      "duration_seconds": 2.32,
      "text": "Okay, that's enough for me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 271.64,
      "end_seconds": 284.01,
      "duration_seconds": 12.37,
      "text": "So, based on the history and the examination, it's hard to say. Shingles is one possibility and contact dermatitis another, and I'd rather not commit yet."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 288.98,
      "end_seconds": 290.46,
      "duration_seconds": 1.48,
      "text": "Is this permanent?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 295.55,
      "end_seconds": 324.06,
      "duration_seconds": 28.51,
      "text": "Nothing I've seen today points to an emergency. It looks like shingles. We'll begin with aciclovir, 800 milligrams, five times a day, seven days. You take it by mouth. That's for shingles. I'll put all of this in writing so you don't have to remember it. Keep the rash covered and stay away from pregnant women and newborn babies until it has crusted. Please come and see me in one week."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CLINICAL_STAFF",
      "start_seconds": 324.95,
      "end_seconds": 328.41,
      "duration_seconds": 3.46,
      "text": "I can put that appointment in for you now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 330.31,
      "end_seconds": 335.27,
      "duration_seconds": 4.96,
      "text": "How would you describe the plan, so we're on the same page?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 337.07,
      "end_seconds": 348.31,
      "duration_seconds": 11.24,
      "text": "So, I take the aciclovir, 800 milligrams, five times a day and come back in one week. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 349.79,
      "end_seconds": 355.31,
      "duration_seconds": 5.52,
      "text": "Yes, exactly right. Anything else on your mind before you go?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 357.36,
      "end_seconds": 360.85,
      "duration_seconds": 3.49,
      "text": "No, that's all. Thanks a lot."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 361.46,
      "end_seconds": 362.88,
      "duration_seconds": 1.42,
      "text": "See you soon."
    }
  ]
}